  "description": {
   "en": "Ihashi Satoru is a new chef at Fujimura, a restaurant owned by veteran chef Kumano.\n\nA chronicle of the lives of the staff and customers of Fujimura.\n\n**Notes:**\n- The series's title is a play on Hana Ichi Monme (Flowers, One Monme), a traditional Japanese children's game somewhat similar to Red Rover.\n- Won the 44th Shougakukan Manga Award in the Seinen Division in 1998.\n- Author Abe Zenta suddenly died in March 1999, ending the series halfway through its 33rd volume."
  },
